B.VD=new A.G(B.n,["Camera studio effects (sunglasses, flower crown, evil-eye earrings, glitter, make-up and light) are drawn with three.js, served from YuMapAI's own site; the 3D models are generated in our own code (no external model or image files). The face mesh comes from MediaPipe (Apache-2.0). three.js is used unchanged (only minified).","Kamera st\xfcdyosu efektleri (g\xfcne\u015f g\xf6zl\xfc\u011f\xfc, \xe7i\xe7ek tac\u0131, nazar k\xfcpe, sim, makyaj ve \u0131\u015f\u0131k) three.js ile \xe7izilir; dosyalar YuMapAI'\u0131n kendi sitesinden gelir. 3B modeller kendi kodumuzda \xfcretilir (d\u0131\u015far\u0131dan model ya da g\xf6rsel dosyas\u0131 yok). Y\xfcz a\u011f\u0131 MediaPipe'tand\u0131r (Apache-2.0). three.js de\u011fi\u015ftirilmeden (yaln\u0131z k\xfc\xe7\xfclt\xfclerek) kullan\u0131l\u0131r."],t.w)
