B.W8=new A.G(B.n,["\u0130stanbul museums come from the IBB Open Data Portal and some \u0130zmir places from \u0130zmir Metropolitan Municipality open data (CC BY 4.0). YuMapAI modified this data (normalized fields, added province and district, matched with other sources). The source credit is shown on the place's detail.","\u0130stanbul m\xfczeleri \u0130BB A\xe7\u0131k Veri Portal\u0131'ndan, baz\u0131 \u0130zmir mek\xe2nlar\u0131 \u0130zmir B\xfcy\xfck\u015fehir Belediyesi a\xe7\u0131k verisinden (CC BY 4.0) gelir. YuMapAI bu verileri de\u011fi\u015ftirmi\u015ftir (alanlar normalize edildi, il ve il\xe7e bilgisi eklendi, ba\u015fka kaynaklarla e\u015fle\u015ftirildi). Kaynak atf\u0131 ilgili mek\xe2n\u0131n detay\u0131nda g\xf6sterilir."],t.w)
