B.We=new A.G(B.n,["Some places' Turkish names, importance and links come from Wikidata. Wikidata structured data is available under CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication): creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","Baz\u0131 mek\xe2nlar\u0131n T\xfcrk\xe7e adlar\u0131, \xf6nem bilgisi ve ba\u011flant\u0131lar\u0131 Wikidata'dan gelir. Wikidata yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f verisi CC0 1.0 (kamu mal\u0131 adama) alt\u0131ndad\u0131r: creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/"],t.w)
