B.Wj=new A.G(B.n,['Place photos come from Wikimedia Commons, only under licenses that allow commercial use and redistribution. Resized copies are kept on the YuMapAI server so they load quickly; each photo\'s card shows the "Photo: author \xb7 license" credit and a link to its source page.','Mek\xe2n foto\u011fraflar\u0131 Wikimedia Commons\'tan, yaln\u0131z ticari kullan\u0131ma ve yeniden da\u011f\u0131t\u0131ma izin veren lisanslarla al\u0131n\u0131r. H\u0131zl\u0131 a\xe7\u0131lmas\u0131 i\xe7in k\xfc\xe7\xfclt\xfclm\xfc\u015f kopyalar\u0131 YuMapAI sunucusunda tutulur; her foto\u011fraf\u0131n kart\u0131nda "Foto: yazar \xb7 lisans" atf\u0131 ve kaynak sayfas\u0131 ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\xf6sterilir.'],t.w)
B.Wk=new A.G(B.n,["The base map is served by OpenFreeMap; map data is by OpenStreetMap contributors under the Open Database License (ODbL 1.0) (openstreetmap.org/copyright). The tile schema is OpenMapTiles. The credit is shown in the corner of every map. OpenStreetMap data is used only as the base map layer.","Haritan\u0131n taban katman\u0131 OpenFreeMap taraf\u0131ndan sunulur; harita verisi OpenStreetMap katk\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131na aittir ve Open Database License (ODbL 1.0) ile lisansl\u0131d\u0131r (openstreetmap.org/copyright). Karo \u015femas\u0131 OpenMapTiles't\u0131r. At\u0131f her haritan\u0131n k\xf6\u015fesinde g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr. OpenStreetMap verisi yaln\u0131z harita taban katman\u0131 olarak kullan\u0131l\u0131r."],t.w)
B.Wl=new A.G(B.n,["Face tracking in the camera studio uses the open-source 8th Wall Engine (Face Effects only), served from YuMapAI's own site. Change notice (20.11.2026): remote addresses (GLTFLoader, WebXR hand profiles, Draco decoder) were removed; nothing else was changed. The closed Distributed Engine Binary is not used.","Kamera st\xfcdyosundaki y\xfcz takibi a\xe7\u0131k kaynak 8th Wall Engine'i (yaln\u0131z Face Effects) kullan\u0131r; dosyalar YuMapAI'\u0131n kendi sitesinden gelir. De\u011fi\u015fiklik beyan\u0131 (20.11.2026): uzak adresler (GLTFLoader, WebXR el profilleri, Draco \xe7\xf6z\xfcc\xfc) kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131; ba\u015fka de\u011fi\u015fiklik yok. Kapal\u0131 Distributed Engine Binary kullan\u0131lmaz."],t.w)
