B.WZ=new A.G(B.n,["The face detection and face mesh models used by the camera studio come from MediaPipe (modified by 8th Wall) and are distributed unchanged; the canonical face mesh data is taken from the MediaPipe Face Landmarker model. Face data is processed only on your device and is never sent or stored.","Kamera st\xfcdyosunun kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131 y\xfcz bulma ve y\xfcz a\u011f\u0131 modelleri MediaPipe k\xf6kenlidir (8th Wall de\u011fi\u015fiklikleriyle) ve de\u011fi\u015ftirilmeden da\u011f\u0131t\u0131l\u0131r; kanonik y\xfcz a\u011f\u0131 verisi MediaPipe Face Landmarker modelinden al\u0131nm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. Y\xfcz verisi yaln\u0131z cihaz\u0131nda i\u015flenir, hi\xe7bir yere g\xf6nderilmez ve saklanmaz."],t.w)
